@startuml ARCH-01-系统上下文与信任边界图
title 图 ARCH-01 系统上下文总览图（华为云 CodeArts Modeling 规范标准）
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E1F5FE
  BorderColor #0288D1
}

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontSize 11
  ArrowColor #1565C0
  ArrowThickness 1.2
}

actor "个人用户\n(Personal User)" as User
component "操作系统平台服务\n<<platform>>\n(Android 12+ / Win 11)" as OS #F5F5F5
component "智能阅读器客户端\n<<subsystem>>\n(双端分立UI + 共享核心)" as Client #E8F5E9
component "服务端基础服务\n<<subsystem>>\n(身份同步 / AI网关 / 任务审计)" as Server #EDE7F6
component "外部受控大模型\n<<external system>>\n(OpenAI Responses API)" as Model #FFF3E0

User --> Client : 本地阅读、笔记、发起问答
User ..> OS : 系统级文件授权
Client --> OS : 访问沙箱文件与硬件凭据
Client --> Server : HTTPS (REST同步 / 授权最少证据流)
Server --> Model : HTTPS (单次Prompt + 裁剪证据)

@enduml
